  vendorName: Landlord Larry
  offerText: Give me some cash right now, and I'll install a 'luxury' air purifier.
    It's a bit bulky, but you will get some fresh air like a new born!
  acceptResultText: Larry drops off a massive, rusty machine. When you turn it on,
    it violently blows black dust everywhere, making you cough uncontrollably
  rejectResultText: Larry scoffs and leaves. The air in your apartment stays incredibly
    stuffy, giving you a dull headache for the hour.
